---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import Modal from "../components/Modal.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="Home">

  <div>
    <h3>About Me</h3>
    <p>
    Hello! My name is AJ, I am a Quantitative UX Researcher and Data Scientist.
    Currently, I am finishing my undergrad degree in Cognitive Science at the <a>University of British Columbia</a>.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div>
    <h3>Work</h3>
    <p>
    I also work part-time as a UX Researcher at <a>Global Relay</a>, where I apply computational techniques to study 
    user behavior at scale to better inform product and design decisions. 
    </p>
  </div>

  <div>
    <h3>Interests</h3>
    <p>
    Outside of work and studies, I am broadly interested in the <a>Philosophies of Mind & Aesthetics</a>, <a>Symbolic Systems</a>
    (Language, Logic, etc.), and <a>Machine Learning</a>. In my spare time, I also enjoy cooking and bouldering.
    </p>
  </div>

</BaseLayout>
